{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09205","headline":"荅冯鲁秀才 · 韦应物","name":"荅冯鲁秀才","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"晨坐枉琼藻，知子返中林。\n澹然山景晏，泉谷响幽禽。\n髣髴谢尘迹，逍遥舒道心。\n顾我腰间绶，端爲华发侵。\n簿书劳应对，篇翰旷不寻。\n薄田失锄耨，生苗安可任。\n徒令慙所问，想望东山岑。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09205.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09205","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}